{
  "slug": "copy-that-sells",
  "name": "Copy That Sells",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Writes copy that sells, not copy that decorates. Print ads, OOH and billboards, headlines, taglines, long-copy ads, landing pages, emails, manifestos, product descriptions. Built on the D&AD Copy Book craft tradition and Robert Bly's direct-response frameworks (4 U's, AIDA, PAS). Uses Cannes Lions and Clio Award print and outdoor winners from the last 25 years as the gold standard. Includes a strict anti-AI writing layer so the output does not read like ChatGPT.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `copy-that-sells` (Write copy that earns attention and drives action).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install copy-that-sells@claude-community` from `avectats7/copy-that-sells`.\n\nIf you have ever asked Claude to write an ad and it came back with \"unlock the potential,\" \"delve into,\" or \"in today's fast-paced world,\" this skill is the fix. The Claude default voice is corporate. The copywriting tradition that made Volkswagen, Avis, Economist, Patek Philippe, Nike, and Penny famous is not. This skill loads the second tradition.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
